// ── Owned projection with an origin (`--owned-origin`) ───────────────
// The owned form above is made by `try_into_owned_in`, which copies each string
// and each byte string out of the view. `try_into_owned_in_origin` makes the same
// form from the view AND the origin the view was decoded from, through the
// container the storage profile holds each entry in, so a profile whose container
// can share that origin holds the entry as a reference to it and copies nothing.
// It is the projection every other generated owned form has under this option,
// and it is rendered after the codec's source interface so that the output with
// the option off is a prefix of the output with it on.

{{ storage.declare_origin(struct_name, storage_gated, storage_origin_bound) }}
